+/// The thinking indicator's Flutter rendering (issue #1374): the shared
+/// kaomoji face set drawn two-tone in the brand palette, swapping on a
+/// RANDOM pick every [kKaomojiSwapPeriod] (~0.9 s) while the phase runs.
